Sableclutch Scrap is a scrapyard in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], run by [[Copperjaw]]. Heaps of scrap fill the yard, and a great crusher flattens old vehicles while a crane swings over the piles. Copperjaw keeps an office in a converted storage container near the gate.

Copperjaw takes on hands directly rather than through an agency, so couriers and guards come to him for work. He pays well for deliveries, as much as 100 gold to carry a locked metal case to the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Diamond District/index|Diamond District]]. Such a case is chained by one half of a magic handcuff to the wrist of whoever carries it, and a doorman unlocks it on arrival.
